a ngoba i-Node.js ivaliwe kule phaneli. Nika amandla i-Node.js kuzilungiselelo zakho CEP, bese uqala kabusha After Effects.","Flex akakwazanga ukuqonda impendulo evela ku-After Effects. Qala kabusha After Effects bese uzama futhi. Imininingwane:","Flex ayikwazanga ukuguqula le vector ukuze ibe SVG. Zama ukuyinamathisela njenge-PNG esikhundleni salokho. Imininingwane:","Flex ayikwazanga ukuvula isithombe sebhodi lokunamathisela. Ingase ibe ngefomethi ethi Flex ayisekeli - zama ukuyikopisha njenge-PNG.","Flex ayikwazanga ukucubungula isithombe sebhodi lokunamathisela. Kopisha futhi, bese unamathisele. Imininingwane:","Flex ayikwazanga ukufunda indlela yefayela ebhodini lakho lokunamathisela. Kopisha ifayela futhi, bese unamathisele.","Flex ayikwazanga ukufunda isithombe ebhodini lakho lokunamathisela. Kopisha futhi, bese unamathisele.","Flex ayikwazanga ukulondoloza ivekhtha eguquliwe. Hlola ukuthi unesikhala sediski samahhala kanye nemvume yokubhalela le folda. Imininingwane:","Flex ayikwazanga ukulondoloza isithombe esinamathiselwe. Hlola ukuthi unesikhala sediski samahhala kanye nemvume yokubhalela le folda. Imininingwane:","Flex ayikwazanga ukushintsha isithombe sebhodi lokunamathisela sibe ifayela. Kopisha futhi, bese unamathisele.","Flex ayikwazanga ukuthola ukuthi izosilondoloza kuphi isithombe esinamathiselwe. Londoloza iphrojekthi yakho, bese uzama futhi.","Flex ayikwazanga ukuthola ukuthi izosilondoloza kuphi isithombe esinamathiselwe. Londoloza iphrojekthi yakho, bese uzama futhi. Imininingwane:","Flex ihamba phambili...","Flex ilahlekelwe ukuxhumana kwayo ne-After Effects. Vala iphaneli bese uyivula futhi, noma uqale kabusha After Effects.","Flex idinga iphrojekthi evuliwe ngaphambi kokuthi inamathisele. Vula noma dala iphrojekthi, bese uyazama futhi.","Flex ufuna ukusho okuthize","I-FlexPack ayinalutho.","Phenya Okuvundlile ngesikali -X","Phenya Uqonde Ngesikali -Y","Ukugeleza nokulula","Imodi yomhleli ogelezayo","Igama lefolda alikwazi ukuqukatha ama-sla